                <a:cs typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202090204" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/>
            </a:rPr><a:t>Claude produces the most diverse proposals, but they are only moderately novel. Human proposals are moderately diverse but most novel. High diversity within AI space may reflect variation among training-data-typical framings, not genuinely new ideas.</a:t></a:r>
